    },
    "message": "Own movement_v1 in a typed row, with its rules still in Python\n\nThe rules write one record at a time, so nothing forwards a whole namespace. Adds the shadow of\nthe row against the tree and the reversed walk of advance_movement, which finds the one\ndependence on order: replans in a tick take the next event number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
