      "sha": "e364451039ee77c3a673cfd181fc4bba56b092a5",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jphacks/tkb_2615/git/trees/e364451039ee77c3a673cfd181fc4bba56b092a5"
    },
    "message": "Pin that a queue slot replanned in a tick depends on who has walked\n\n_queue_slot_position reads the positions of those ahead in the queue, which the same walk of\nadvance_movement writes. With the head leaving the follower's slot, the follower gets that slot in\norder and the next one in reverse. The state is made by hand: no gate scenario or 7-day run takes\nthis branch, so their reversed hashes cannot see it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
