    "message": "Record the movement state lane's results and contracts\n\nmovement_v1 is owned with its rules in Python; body_state_v1 and social_network_v1 are not owned\nhere. The lane document has the budget, the shadow and kernel counts, the reversed runs and what\nthey cannot see.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
